#VRML V2.0 utf8
# Project-authored standards fixture (oracle/standards/README.md).
# Clause numbers are those of the Web3D free copy of ISO/IEC 14772-1:1997; equality with the ISO text UNVERIFIED.
# 4.9.3: the URL has no "#name", so the first PROTO statement of first-proto-library.wrl
# (excluding EXTERNPROTOs) defines Chosen. That PROTO is Leading. The name of that prototype does
# not need to match the name given in the EXTERNPROTO statement.
EXTERNPROTO Chosen [ field SFFloat height ] "first-proto-library.wrl"
DEF ChosenDefault Chosen { }
DEF ChosenExplicit Chosen { height 1 }
